---
permalink: /ui_kits/website/music.html
headline: Music & Choir
deck: Music is at the heart of worship at Emmanuel — and our choir combines choral excellence with a welcoming, inclusive spirit.
intro_paragraphs:
  - text: "We believe that music plays a pivotal part in congregational worship, enhancing and deepening our connection to God."
  - text: "Our choir combines choral excellence with a welcoming and inclusive spirit. We sing at the 10:30am Eucharist every Sunday, offering a diverse repertoire of sacred music, ranging from Renaissance polyphony to contemporary works. In addition to our weekly worship, the choir leads the music for special services at key points in the liturgical year."
  - text: "We are always keen to welcome new singers and musicians of all ages and abilities. The choir rehearses once a week from 7:15–8:15pm on Wednesday evenings, and sings as part of the 10:30am Eucharist each Sunday. Whilst regular commitment is encouraged, it is not necessary to be available for every rehearsal and service to be a member of the choir."
  - text: "We are a friendly and welcoming choir, with a great social scene, often going for drinks post-rehearsal. An ability to read sheet music is desirable, but not necessary provided you have a willingness to learn. If you are interested, please contact our Director of Music, Will, at w.g.rose41@gmail.com."
features:
  - eyebrow: For our youngest singers
    heading: Children's Choir
    body_paragraphs:
      - Come and sing with the Emmanuel Church choir! We rehearse once a week in the church with our choir director, Will. We sing in the church on the first Sunday of every month, and also in special services, including at Easter.
      - We learn loads of exciting music, and always have lots of fun in our rehearsals. You don't need to be able to read sheet music to join, and it's a great way to make new friends! All rehearsals are free to attend.
    image: /assets/cms/site-images/choir-children.jpg
    image_alt: Robed young choristers gathered at the altar during a sung service
    reverse: false
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<title>Music &amp; Choir — Emmanuel Church, West Hampstead</title>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles.css" />
<style>
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { margin: 0; background: var(--paper); font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--ink); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }

  .mu-intro { padding: 96px var(--gutter) 100px; }
  .mu-intro .inner { max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 380px; gap: 80px; align-items: start; }
  .mu-intro .lead-para,
  .mu-intro .intro-body > p:first-child { font-family: var(--font-editorial); font-size: 30px; line-height: 1.34; color: var(--ink); font-style: italic; margin: 0 0 30px; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .mu-intro p { font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--fs-body); line-height: var(--lh-relaxed); color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0 0 22px; }
  .mu-intro p a { color: var(--brown); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }



  .childrens { padding: 110px var(--gutter); }
  .childrens .inner { max-width: 1320px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .childrens .em-feature h2 { margin-top: 14px; }
  .childrens .em-feature .media { aspect-ratio: 4/3; }
  .childrens .em-feature p a { color: var(--brown); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

  .flag { display:block; width:fit-content; white-space: nowrap; font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.16em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--brown); background: var(--paper-warm); border: 1px dashed var(--brown-soft); padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 22px; }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .mu-intro .inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 36px; }
  }
</style>
<link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/favicon.ico" />
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/assets/favicon-32.png" />
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" sizes="180x180" href="/assets/apple-touch-icon.png" />
</head>
<body>

{% include "header.njk" %}

  <!-- Page head -->
  <section class="em-pagehead">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="em-breadcrumb">
        <a href="index.html">Home</a><span class="sep">/</span>
        <a href="#">Get Involved</a><span class="sep">/</span>
        <span>Music &amp; Choir</span>
      </div>
      <h1 data-editable="text" data-prop="headline" data-type="span">{{ headline }}</h1>
      <p class="deck" data-editable="text" data-prop="deck" data-type="text">{{ deck }}</p>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <div class="item"><div class="k">Sings</div><div class="v">Sundays, 10:30 Eucharist</div></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="k">Rehearsals</div><div class="v">Children’s choir Wednesdays, 6:15–7pm<br/>Adult choir Wednesdays, 7:15–8:15pm</div></div>
        <div class="item"><div class="k">Director of Music</div><div class="v">Will Rose</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="mu-intro">
    <div class="inner">
      <div class="intro-body">
        <div data-editable="array" data-prop="intro_paragraphs">
        {% for para in intro_paragraphs %}
          <p data-editable="array-item">
            <span data-editable="text" data-prop="text" data-type="text">{{ para.text if para.text else para }}</span>
          </p>
        {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="em-aside">
        <div class="em-aside-card">
          <h4>Sing with us</h4>
          <p class="big" style="margin-bottom:16px">All ages &amp; abilities welcome</p>
          <p><b style="color:var(--ink)">Rehearsals</b><br/>Children’s choir Wednesdays, 6:15–7pm<br/>Adult choir Wednesdays, 7:15–8:15pm</p>
          <p><b style="color:var(--ink)">Sings</b><br/>Sunday 10:30 Eucharist &amp; major festivals</p>
          <a href="mailto:w.g.rose41@gmail.com" class="em-btn em-btn--primary" style="margin-top:8px">Email Will Rose</a>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  {% for feature in features %}
  <section class="childrens" data-editable="array" data-prop="features">
    <div class="inner" data-editable="array-item">
      <div class="em-feature{% if feature.reverse %} em-feature--reverse{% endif %}">
        <div class="media em-well"><img src="{{ feature.image }}" alt="{{ feature.image_alt }}" /></div>
        <div>
          <div class="em-ornament is-leading" data-editable="text" data-prop="eyebrow" data-type="span">{{ feature.eyebrow }}</div>
          <h2 data-editable="text" data-prop="heading" data-type="span">{{ feature.heading }}</h2>
          {% for para in feature.body_paragraphs %}
          <p>{{ para.text if para.text else para }}</p>
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}

{% include "footer.njk" %}

</body>
</html>
